sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as 业务客户端 / 工作流节点
    participant SG as SubmitGuard (契约门禁)
    participant ARC as AspectRatioOp (画幅收敛算子)
    participant Router as OperationRouter (模式分发)
    participant Formatter as VendorPayloadMapper (发包层)
    participant Gateway as OmniMux Gateway (/v1/*)
    participant Channel as Channel Adaptor (APIMart/fal/volc/sora/kling)
    participant Upstream as 上游大模型服务提供商

    Note over Client, SG: 1. 提交前契约与模式准入校验
    Client->>SG: submitTask(modelId, operation, logicalInputs, extras)
    SG->>SG: admitDisposition(modelId) & validateOperation(operation)

    Note over SG, ARC: 2. 画幅标准与清晰度收敛转换
    SG->>ARC: normalizeAspectRatio(family, modelId, aspectRatio, resolution)
    alt OpenAI 图像家族 (gpt-image-2*)
        ARC-->>SG: 聚类转换 -> size: "1024x1024" | "1024x1792" | "1792x1024" (禁止 aspect_ratio)
    else Grok 图像/视频家族 (grok-imagine-*)
        ARC-->>SG: 透传 8 档 aspect_ratio: "16:9" / "9:16" / "3:2" / ... (禁止绝对像素 size)
    else Kling 视频家族 (kling-*)
        ARC-->>SG: 注入 metadata.aspect_ratio 与 aspect_ratio 字段 (规避 adaptor 默认 1:1 bug)
    else Wan 视频家族 (wan-3.0)
        ARC-->>SG: 透传 size 比例字符串，强制大写 resolution: "720P" / "1080P"
    else Seedance 视频家族 (seedance-*)
        ARC-->>SG: 透传 size 比例字符串，强制小写 resolution: "720p" / "1080p"
    end

    Note over SG, Router: 3. 模态操作判定与端到端端点打通
    SG->>Router: resolveEndpoint(profileId, operation, bindings)
    alt 图像文生图
        Router-->>SG: POST /v1/images/generations
    else 图像图生图 / 多图参考 (multi_reference)
        Router-->>SG: POST /v1/images/edits (携带 image/images 或 multipart)
    else 视频多模态 / Suno 音乐任务
        Router-->>SG: POST /v1/video/generations (异步媒体任务)
    else 语音合成 (TTS)
        Router-->>SG: POST /v1/audio/speech (同步二进制/流)
    else 语音识别 (ASR: 豆包大模型)
        Router-->>SG: POST /v1/audio/transcriptions (URL-first 极速转写)
    end

    Note over SG, Formatter: 4. Profile 白名单过滤与 Vendor Payload 构建
    SG->>Formatter: mapValidatedPlanToVendor()
    Formatter->>Formatter: assertVendorBodyAllowed(vendor, profile, operation)
    Formatter-->>SG: vendorPayload

    Note over SG, Gateway: 5. 网关转发与通道适配
    SG->>Gateway: HTTP Request (对应端点)
    Gateway->>Channel: 分发到对应渠道适配器
    Channel->>Upstream: 调用服务提供商 API
    Upstream-->>Channel: 返回任务 ID 或同步产物
    Channel-->>Gateway: 封装标准响应
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 { id, task_id, status, data }
